      "textf2146f80022a": "Create a GitHub App",
      "textf21a7cc2d177": "Every run is routed through a single gateway, so the model stays a setting instead of an architecture. Switch per agent, per task, or to whatever ships next week.",
      "textf2daa18861b5": "Bundle",
