      "text12836c0e435d": "Free is $0 — one project, 500 credits a month, managed models and every feature, with your own key for any other model. Paid plans are credits: pick a monthly amount, members are free and unlimited, and one pool covers the whole account. Self-hosting the software costs nothing; you pay your own model bill and your own compute bill instead.",
